From 06e230dadf5c3f9342e2e9e3c45e5f8f428512f3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Venture CRM <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 25 Nov 2026 11:40:37 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Rebrand to Venture Management

Logos, icons, fonts and install manifest from the Venture Management
brand board:

- public/brand: logo shapes taken straight from the brand board PDF. A
  side-by-side lockup for the 32px sidebar and sign-in slots, the stacked
  brand-board logo (logo-stacked*.svg) for the share image, and a navy
  app tile with the cream V mark for icons and the favicon.
- Every PNG icon regenerated with npm run generate-icons (navy and cream
  backgrounds instead of SyncEstate charcoal).
- Fonts: Roboto for body text, Raleway for h1-h3 (replaces Geist).
- manifest.json: Venture Management name and colours.
- docs/venture.env.example: the NEXT_PUBLIC_BRAND_* values to put in
  .env.local and Vercel.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01RmKNDpjNdySfmdPcX1cZYD
